    <patterns>
      <pattern name="snake_case mirror-first contract" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeDraftDisposition.cs">
        `ComposeDraftPayload` record with `[JsonPropertyName("snake_case")]`; mirror each additive field 1:1 in `types/compose-contracts.ts`. Do not add property-level boolean `required`.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="grounding signal source" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/AnnotationReanchorService.cs">
        The re-anchor Levenshtein score + presence of `sources` / retained-original support are the verifiability inputs the band derivation reads — server-side, no AI-internal injection.
      </pattern>
