  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + dependency check">Confirm task 012 (paraId substrate) is landed. Run the FULL rigor-level declaration. Load `bff-extensions.md` + the ADR knowledge files. State the Placement Justification (extension of `Services/Compose`; additive contract field; no new surface).</step>
    <step order="1" name="Add the additive contract fields (server)">In `ComposeDraftDisposition.cs`, add `confidence_band` (a `high`/`medium`/`low` enum serialized as its snake/lower string) to the `ComposeDraftPayload` record, and add `paraId` + `start_offset` + `end_offset` to the server anchor counterpart. Keep them optional/additive; NO boolean `required`. snake_case `[JsonPropertyName]`.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Mirror the fields (client)">Mirror the identical additive shape in `types/compose-contracts.ts` — `confidence_band?: 'high' | 'medium' | 'low'` on the draft payload and `paraId?` + `start_offset?` / `end_offset?` on `AnchoredAnnotationAnchor` (lines 108-115). Keep server + client shapes identical.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Implement the server-side band derivation">In the draft-materialization path (`ComposeService` / `ComposeDraftDisposition`), derive `confidence_band` from verifiability evidence: cited-source presence + retained-original support + re-anchor score =&gt; `high`; weak support =&gt; `medium`; no grounding signal =&gt; `low` (or omit). Read only grounding signals already present (no new AI call, no AI-internal injection). Populate `paraId`/offsets from the E2 anchor.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Unit + derivation tests">Author tests in `tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/Services/Compose/` asserting: grounded suggestion =&gt; `high`; ungrounded =&gt; `low`; the additive fields round-trip through serialize/deserialize; no catalog row is read/modified.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Through-the-wire seam slice test">Add a `WebApplicationFactory` slice test (`tests/integration/seam/**`) that drives the dispatch/serialize path and asserts `confidence_band` + `paraId`/offsets are present on the payload the client actually receives (NFR-06). No transport mocks.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Verify + size/CVE/facade report">Build BFF + client shared lib; run the new tests. Run the ADR-013 NetArchTest facade check (`Services/Compose` injects no AI internals). Report publish size absolute + delta vs ~49.63 MB (expect ~0). Verify no new HIGH CVE. Update TASK-INDEX status.</step>
  </steps>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeDraftDisposition.cs (additive `confidence_band` + anchor paraId/offsets)</output>
    <output type="code">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeService.cs (server-side band derivation from grounding)</output>
    <output type="code">src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/types/compose-contracts.ts (mirrored additive fields)</output>
    <output type="test">tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/Services/Compose/ (band-derivation + additive-mirror tests)</output>
